Final business thesis
SignatureServe should not position itself as “another Easysnap” or claim to invent fold-and-squeeze packaging.
The stronger positioning is:
SignatureServe is building a premium branded single-serve ecosystem for hospitality and consumer brands—turning ordinary portions into memorable brand touchpoints.

The first experiment should therefore be restaurant-branded ketchup/mayo/sauce packs, because restaurants already purchase these products and the branding benefit is easy to demonstrate.
The long-term vision can expand from:
Ketchup → sauces → hotel amenities → cosmetics → travel → broader branded single-serve products.
In one sentence:
SignatureServe helps restaurants, hotels and brands turn the smallest products their customers use into a recognizable part of their brand experience.
